{"q":"227","t":"Basic Calculator II","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a string <code>s</code> which represents an expression, <em>evaluate this expression and return its value</em>.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The integer division should truncate toward zero.</p>\n\n<p>You may assume that the given expression is always valid. All intermediate results will be in the range of <code>[-2<sup>31</sup>, 2<sup>31</sup> - 1]</code>.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> You are not allowed to use any built-in function which evaluates strings as mathematical expressions, such as <code>eval()</code>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> s = \"3+2*2\"\n<strong>Output:</strong> 7\n</pre><p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> s = \" 3/2 \"\n<strong>Output:</strong> 1\n</pre><p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> s = \" 3+5 / 2 \"\n<strong>Output:</strong> 5\n</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 3 * 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>s</code> consists of integers and operators <code>(&#39;+&#39;, &#39;-&#39;, &#39;*&#39;, &#39;/&#39;)</code> separated by some number of spaces.</li>\n\t<li><code>s</code> represents a valid expression.</li>\n\t<li>All the integers in the expression are non-negative integers in the range <code>[0, 2<sup>31</sup> - 1]</code>.</li>\n\t<li>The answer is <strong>guaranteed</strong> to fit in a <strong>32-bit integer</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"calculate\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"s\",\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"Stack","slug":"stack"}],"s":[{"t":"Basic Calculator","s":"basic-calculator","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Expression Add Operators","s":"expression-add-operators","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Basic Calculator III","s":"basic-calculator-iii","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Evaluate Valid Expressions","s":"evaluate-valid-expressions","d":"Hard","p":false}],"co":[["Meta","facebook"],["Apple","apple"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Expedia","expedia"],["Snap","snapchat"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["IXL","ixl"],["Uber","uber"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["DE Shaw","de-shaw"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Tesla","tesla"],["Rivian","rivian"],["Verkada","verkada"],["Motive","motive"],["DoorDash","doordash"],["Yandex","yandex"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Zoho","zoho"],["Zoox","zoox"],["Adobe","adobe"],["ByteDance","bytedance"],["Snowflake","snowflake"],["Palo Alto Networks","palo-alto-networks"],["Airbnb","airbnb"]],"cs":{"a":[["Google","google",2],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",2]],"b":[["Apple","apple",5],["Meta","facebook",4],["Amazon","amazon",2],["TikTok","tiktok",2],["Expedia","expedia",2]],"m":[["Microsoft","microsoft",11],["Snap","snapchat",10],["Tesla","tesla",8],["Rokt","rokt",8],["Uber","uber",6],["DoorDash","doordash",6],["IXL","ixl",6],["ByteDance","bytedance",5],["Yandex","yandex",5],["Verkada","verkada",5]]}}